      "content": "The known response mismatch throws before the database snapshot assertion runs, so this expected-failure test never checks the independent requirement that an unverified backup cannot cause writes. It also passes if setup or apply throws for an unrelated reason. Put the no-write invariant in a normal test (accepting the currently known response if necessary), and isolate the expected response mismatch in the expected-failure case.",
